  "document": "Ertem Eğilmez\nErtem Eğilmez( 18 February 1929, Trabzon – 21 September 1989, Istanbul, Turkey) was a Turkish film director, producer and screenwriter. He is known as the name behind some of the most popular films in Turkish film history. Many of these were produced by his production company Arzu Film."
